	"Description": "[center][size=4][b]Sweet Trees[/b][/size]\n<br />\n<br />[size=3]This mod is only applied in winter to make it more colorful and sweet.\n<br />But you can download the version for all seasons if you prefer.\n<br />\n<br />It's for [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/9246]Alternative Textures[/url]\uFEFF, but some trees are not yet compatible, so you also need [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915]Content Patcher[/url]\uFEFF for some of them (choose the colors using [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5098]GMCM[/url]\uFEFF).\n<br />\n<br />[/size][size=3]Use [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/24029]No Stump Winter Trees[/url]\uFEFF for a better experience.[/size][/center]",
